<title>Flash the image &mdash; utsugi-pmaports</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css?v=@CSSV@">
<header><div>
	<a class="brand" href="index.html"><i></i>utsugi/pmaports</a>
	<nav>
	<a href="index.html">Start</a>
	<a href="install.html" aria-current="page">Install</a>
	<a href="devices.html">Devices</a>
	<a href="packages.html">What is inside</a>
	<a href="contribute.html">Contribute</a>
	</nav>
</div></header>
<section class="panel">
	<div class="wrap">
		<div class="eyebrow">Route 1 &middot; recommended</div>
		<h1>Flash the ready image</h1>
		<p class="lede">One download, everything inside: kernel, hardware fixes, the
		six own applications, browser, mail, maps, photos. About 1&nbsp;GB
		compressed.</p>
		<p><a class="btn" href="https://github.com/utsugi-pmos/utsugi-pmaports/releases/latest">Download the latest image</a></p>
	</div>
</section>

<section>
	<div class="wrap">
		<div class="h"><span>01</span><h2>Before you start</h2></div>
		<div class="scroll">
		<table>
			<tr><th>Bootloader</th><td>Unlocked. Xiaomi's wait applies.</td></tr>
			<tr><th>U-Boot</th><td>On <code>boot</code> already, matched to your panel.
			If this phone has never run postmarketOS, do
			<a href="install-pmos.html">route 3</a> first &mdash; only its U-Boot step.</td></tr>
			<tr><th>Your data</th><td>Gone. This writes the whole system
			partition.</td></tr>
			<tr><th>Encryption</th><td>None. Want it? <a href="install-encrypted.html">Route 4</a>.</td></tr>
		</table>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="panel">
	<div class="wrap">
		<div class="h"><span>02</span><h2>Flash it</h2></div>
		<div class="sh">
			<div class="bar"><i></i><span>ON YOUR PC</span></div>
			<pre>sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS                      <b># must say OK</b>
xz -d utsugi-surya-*.img.xz
fastboot flash userdata utsugi-surya-*.img   <b># userdata. never boot.</b>
fastboot reboot</pre>
		</div>
		<p>The phone boots to the desktop. First boot takes a minute longer.</p>
		<div class="note"><i></i><div>
			<b>Log in and change the password.</b>
			The image ships user <code>user</code> with password <code>147147</code>,
			because an image has to have one. Change it: <code>passwd</code>.
		</div></div>
	</div>
</section>

<section>
	<div class="wrap">
		<div class="h"><span>03</span><h2>Then</h2></div>
		<div class="scroll">
		<table>
			<tr><th>Wifi</th><td>Settings, as usual. Nothing is preconfigured.</td></tr>
			<tr><th>Updates</th><td><code>sudo apk upgrade</code>. The repository line
			and the signing key are already inside, kernel included.</td></tr>
			<tr><th>Getting back to fastboot</th><td><code>sudo reboot-to-bootloader</code>.
			<code>systemctl reboot bootloader</code> does not work here.</td></tr>
		</table>
		</div>
		<div class="next">
			<a href="devices.html"><b>Read</b><span>What does not work</span></a>
			<a href="packages.html"><b>See</b><span>What is inside</span></a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
